9,1997,79,109,20]],"links":[["Schoolcraft County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/michigan/schoolcraft-county"],["ARC or PLC in Schoolcraft County","/arc-plc/michigan/schoolcraft-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025, September to October landed at 56% of normal on the middle of the grids, and October to November at 71% that same year. Grid 31076 had its driest year in 1989 at 69% of normal.</p>"}
